{"title": "Heavily Armoured", "pageid": 4939, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heavily_Armoured", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Heavily_Armoured.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Heavily_Armoured.webp/300px-Heavily_Armoured.webp, /w/images/b/b1/Heavily_Armoured.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Heavily_Armoured.webp/300px-Heavily_Armoured.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Heavily_Armoured.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Heavily Armoured</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. You gain Proficiency with Heavy Armour and your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> increases by 1.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain Proficiency with Heavy Armour and your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> increases by 1, to a maximum of 20. \n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">You must have <b>Medium Armour Proficiency</b> before you can take this feat.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Armoured_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavily Armoured (Feat)\">Heavily Armoured (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195827\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 526/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2682/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1813/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 752582/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.648      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   32.648      1 -total\n 34.22%   11.173      1 Template:Prereq\n 26.25%    8.571      1 Template:Template_style\n 14.91%    4.869      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.97%    4.561      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.02%    4.250      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 12.19%    3.981      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  6.63%    2.166      1 Template:Small_icon\n  6.39%    2.085      3 Template:IfEmpty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4939-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195827 and revision id 197692. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}